          "summary": "<p>财新网08月04日电: 沪指开盘报3816.37点，涨幅0.18%。</p><p>深成指报13572.95点，涨幅0.93%；创业板指报3353.51点，涨幅1.54%；中小板指报8352.50点，涨幅0.77%。</p><p>盘面上，电子领涨，通信、综合、医药生物、计算机、机械设备等板块涨幅居前，银行领跌，食品饮料、石油石化、煤炭、非银金融、房地产等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，全球首个离岸中国国债期货香港上市，吴清表示，支持企业跨境双向融资；美股七巨头指数上涨3.6%，创3月31日以来最佳单日表现；特朗普称美伊正在对话，是伊朗签署协议的“最后机会”；韩国总统办公室官员因杠杆ETF面临刑事指控；阿里正式发布新一代基座大模型Qwen3.8，总参数量2.4万亿；速成车乱象整顿，新能源车强制3万公里可靠性试验。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-08-04</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018854\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018854\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">申菱环境<p><span class=\"stock-no\">301018.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">7.64</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+7.64</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">申菱环境：关于向不特定对象发行可转换公司债券的审核问询函回复及募集说明书等申请文件更新的提示性公告</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101013060\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101013060\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">杭州银行<p><span class=\"stock-no\">600926.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.24</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.24</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">两度延期后到期失效杭州银行80亿元定增方案终止</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caix